      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "id": "el:db3b6e79358f68e2cd12475be30fce88b9eed28dc45a6c00ee63ae1d7a387272",
      "document_id": "doc:4c2d6924bc0d15ca935721b47b86424bfc2079f1610844b69b834a42f39e1ffb",
      "locator_key": "html:LEGIARTI000033517537:reasoning-p1",
      "revision": "075b85cd4285be179282ab6c8853ceacdf0579c0303f265a32b10200c0453b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "text": "Pour l'application du présent chapitre, le bénéficiaire effectif est la ou les personnes physiques :",
      "location": {
        "format": "html",
        "article_id": "LEGIARTI000033517537",
        "selector": "div.content.fr-mb-6v.fr-text--md > p:nth-of-type(1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "id": "el:d68a40fbe401c58ff8be1050aaa81f3358277e27be3c33cc3ad73a2ccbc434e3",
      "document_id": "doc:4c2d6924bc0d15ca935721b47b86424bfc2079f1610844b69b834a42f39e1ffb",
      "locator_key": "html:LEGIARTI000033517537:reasoning-p3",
      "revision": "22dae7eae071665d53c08698b32611ab173ae948841ec875c4c722df341f1097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "text": "1° Soit qui contrôlent en dernier lieu, directement ou indirectement, le client ;",
      "location": {
        "format": "html",
        "article_id": "LEGIARTI000033517537",
        "selector": "div.content.fr-mb-6v.fr-text--md > p:nth-of-type(3)"
      }
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "id": "el:df121088eba02460d4a011a4487ebe536e7ca3a56529610c21366398515340bc",
      "document_id": "doc:4c2d6924bc0d15ca935721b47b86424bfc2079f1610844b69b834a42f39e1ffb",
      "locator_key": "html:LEGIARTI000033517537:reasoning-p5",
      "revision": "91981e14606e8090f84f825e59105cf389b80a00294d9864a881ee1bdab92fad",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "text": "2° Soit pour laquelle une opération est exécutée ou une activité exercée.",
      "location": {
        "format": "html",
        "article_id": "LEGIARTI000033517537",
        "selector": "div.content.fr-mb-6v.fr-text--md > p:nth-of-type(5)"
      }
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "id": "el:f67d0069971e4f46ef54ee79120fb3bb717d4f41c1bebe40b5d121cc45730f71",
      "document_id": "doc:4c2d6924bc0d15ca935721b47b86424bfc2079f1610844b69b834a42f39e1ffb",
      "locator_key": "html:LEGIARTI000033517537:reasoning-p7",
      "revision": "683d3539de5e1f61d0b721213024009476a608e1cbecd056947c41f33e4fdc2b",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "text": "Un décret en Conseil d'Etat précise la définition et les modalités de détermination du bénéficiaire effectif.",
      "location": {
        "format": "html",
        "article_id": "LEGIARTI000033517537",
        "selector": "div.content.fr-mb-6v.fr-text--md > p:nth-of-type(7)"
      }
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "id": "el:ab20549f33da9c48112c44c9cfebb79ff99b73ccc464b58ddb1de4f02a584a41",
      "document_id": "doc:2ba08cdda9d0bb0fa3186693864bc26543a80dbb5b2457e1d247b05f98583d14",
      "locator_key": "markdown:scenario",
      "revision": "27de7636d0cb74bced0ee0ff89ee5a30a19f145d35e2d14364359d088cb2ee82",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "text": "# Synthetic AML/CFT case\n\nAlice and Bob are natural persons. Alice ultimately controls Demo Client.\nAn operation for Demo Client is executed for Bob. For this example only,\nDemo Client is within the cited chapter and the decree-dependent determination\nrequirements are explicitly assumed satisfied for both people.\nThese are stipulated test facts, not findings about real people or compliance.\n",
      "location": {
        "format": "markdown",
        "heading_path": [
          "Synthetic AML/CFT case"
        ],
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 7
      }
    }
  ],
  "chunks": [
